"Tom, Sanford and I have a long history together, and some of the most formative and rewarding experiences of my career came during the years we worked together at Fox. Tom saw the future of my career before I did, and he bet on me early and with a bighearted (and loud!) conviction that is one of his trademarks, and for which I&#x2019;ll be forever grateful. 21 Laps was built on empowering fellow filmmakers and helping them tell stories imbued with their unique voices and visions. Along with my entire 21 Laps team, I&#x2019;m thrilled to begin this next chapter with the team at Sony, and am excited about the wide-open breadth of opportunity across Sony&#x2019;s many labels. I deeply value their commitment to theatrical filmmaking," said Levy. 21 Laps feature canon has minted more than $5 billion at the global box office, which includes the highest grossing R-rated movie ever, Disney/Marvel&#x2019;s Deadpool & Wolverine which made $1.33B, that pic directed, produced and co-written by Levy. 21 Laps was also behind A24's highest grossing movie ever, Backrooms, which made $400.3M and was part of a YouTube creator renaissance at the box office. 21 Laps executive produced Netflix&#x2019;s Emmy-winning Stranger Things and will executive produce the upcoming live action prequel series Other Worlds: A Stranger Things Adventure .

Levy's directed and produced Star Wars: Starfighter , starring Ryan Gosling, arrives in theaters on May 28, 2027. The duo will reteam together again on Marvel's Ghost Rider which is opening on July 28, 2028. 21 Laps upcoming projects also include Universal Pictures&#x2019; romantic comedy The Catch , starring Emma Stone and Chris Pine; Netflix&#x2019;s drama series The Sticks , starring Michelle Monaghan; Amazon MGM Studios&#x2019; supernatural horror film Seasons ; Netflix&#x2019;s feature comedy One Attempt Remaining , starring Jennifer Garner and John Cena; and an untitled Netflix spy feature starring Kevin Hart and Henry Cavill. Sony Pictures&#x2019; charted the third highest grossing movie ever with Spider-Man: Brand New Day ($2.5 billion) which is also the highest grossing movie at the North American box office at $959M. The studio recently revived Resident Evil with Weapons director Zach Cregger which has grossed over $400M, the highest grossing installment in the 24-year old feature franchise based on the Capcom videogame. Up next is Jumanji: Open World , the third film in the $1.8 billion Jumanji franchise, opening Christmas Day. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dl-mid-article-inject2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article2","mid-articleX","mid-article","mid","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[300,250],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

UTA is holding a summit Nov. 30 to bring students and early-career professionals behind the scenes of the creator business.

The invite-only event, entitled The Business of Representing Creators, will take place at the UTA headquarters and explore how agents and managers build businesses for online influencers, as well as how to represent creators. The summit follows UTA&#x2019;s appointment of seven agents to its Creators Leadership Team, as well as its efforts to bring in the next generation of talent.

Expected speakers include Partner and UTA Creators Co-Head Ali Berman, UTA Creators Partners Mahzad Babayan and Ty Flynn, Creators Agents Rebecca Steinberg and Ike Zhang, DBA Partner Hilary Williams, VP of Creator Brand Partnerships Natasha Vaquer and Media Rights Agent Addison Duffy, among others.

&#x201C;As creators become founders, producers and media company owners, they&#x2019;re changing how entertainment is made, how audiences connect and how businesses are built,&#x201D; said UTA Creators Co-Heads and Partners Oren Rosenbaum, Berman and Raina Penchansky. &#x201C;Representing them means thinking just as expansively about what&#x2019;s possible. We&#x2019;ve spent two decades helping shape this business, and investing in the next generation of agents, managers and entertainment leaders is an important part of what comes next. Their ideas and perspectives will help move the industry forward and create new opportunities for our clients and the broader creator community.&#x201D;

&#x201C;Curiosity and collaboration are at the heart of UTA&#x2019;s culture, and this summit opens our doors and shares that experience with the next generation,&#x201D; said Laura Roenick, Partner & SVP, People at UTA. &#x201C;We&#x2019;re excited to connect emerging professionals with the people powering the creator business to help them see how their passion and strengths can translate into meaningful careers.&#x201D;

Shawn Levy 's 21 Laps Entertainment has signed a major overall film deal with Sony Pictures.

21 Laps lands at Sony after a competitive process with multiple studios bidding to get into business with the blockbuster filmmaker and his prolific production company. The rich new deal extends across all of Sony Pictures&#x2019; labels and begins in fall 2027.

The pact also reunites Levy with Sony Pictures Motion Picture Group chairman and CEO Tom Rothman and Motion Picture Group president Sanford Panitch. The trio's relationship goes back more than two decades, boasting some of Levy's early successes as a director and producer, including the &#x201C;Night at the Museum&#x201D; movies, &#x201C;Cheaper by the Dozen&#x201D; and &#x201C;Date Night.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories 'Chasing Summer' Director Josephine Decker Says That ‘Filmmaking Is Lonelier Than Ever,’ So It’s Time to Build a Community

&#x201C;I go ALL the way back with Shawn. We made a pile of hits together before he went on to far greater successes, none of which surprised me in the slightest,&#x201D; Rothman said in a statement announcing the news.

&#x201C;His talent as a producer, director and head of the coolest creative company around, is rivaled only by his unmatched enthusiasm,&#x201D; Rothman continued. &#x201C;I feel lucky as hell to reunite, and excited for everyone at Sony to discover what I have long known &#x2014; Shawn Levy is the real deal.&#x201D;

Levy, whose 21 Laps will celebrate its 21st anniversary next year, was equally enthused.

&#x201C;Tom, Sanford and I have a long history together, and some of the most formative and rewarding experiences of my career came during the years we worked together at Fox,&#x201D; Levy said in a statement. &#x201C;Tom saw the future of my career before I did, and he bet on me early and with a big-hearted (and loud!) conviction that is one of his trademarks, and for which I&#x2019;ll be forever grateful.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

About the future of the company, Levy added: &#x201C;21 Laps was built on empowering fellow filmmakers and helping them tell stories imbued with their unique voices and visions. Along with my entire 21 Laps team, I&#x2019;m thrilled to begin this next chapter with the team at Sony, and am excited about the wide-open breadth of opportunity across Sony&#x2019;s many labels. I deeply value their commitment to theatrical filmmaking.&#x201D;

News of the Sony Pictures deal comes after Levy and 21 Laps set an overall TV deal at Disney&#x2018;s 20th Television in September, following a long tenure at Netflix. The watermark for the company's TV business is, of course, executive producing Netflix&#x2019;s groundbreaking and Emmy-winning series &#x201C;Stranger Things.&#x201D; 21 Laps will executive produce the upcoming live-action prequel series &#x201C;Other Worlds: A Stranger Things Adventure.&#x201D;

21 Laps films have grossed more than $5 billion at the worldwide box office. Recent successes include Marvel&#x2019;s &#x201C;Deadpool & Wolverine,&#x201D; directed, produced and co-written by Levy, which grossed more than $1.3 billion worldwide, and A24&#x2019;s &#x201C;Backrooms,&#x201D; which became the studio&#x2019;s highest-grossing release worldwide. Next year, Levy will debut the much-anticipated &#x201C;Star Wars: Starfighter.&#x201D; The film, directed and produced by Levy and starring Ryan Gosling, will launch in theaters on May 28, 2027. Levy will then reteam with Gosling and Marvel for &#x201C;Ghost Rider,&#x201D; which is slated for a July 28, 2028 theatrical release.

The company's slate of upcoming projects also includes Universal Pictures&#x2019; romantic comedy &#x201C;The Catch,&#x201D; starring Emma Stone and Chris Pine; Netflix&#x2019;s drama series &#x201C;The Sticks,&#x201D; starring Michelle Monaghan; Amazon MGM Studios&#x2019; supernatural horror film &#x201C;Seasons&#x201D;; Netflix&#x2019;s feature comedy &#x201C;One Attempt Remaining,&#x201D; starring Jennifer Garner and John Cena; and an untitled Netflix spy feature starring Kevin Hart and Henry Cavill.

Levy and 21 Laps Entertainment are represented by WME and Wendy Kirk at JSSK.

EXCLUSIVE: Kasi Lemmons , the director of the Oscar-nominated Harriet Tubman biopic Harriet and TriStar's Whitney Houston: I Wanna Dance with Somebody , has been tapped to adapt an executive memoir for Scott Budnick 's 1Community .

The book, by former Nike Jordan Brand chairman Larry Miller and daughter Laila Lacy, is titled Jump: My Secret Journey from the Streets to the Boardroom . Published in 2022, it chronicles Miller's rise from the streets of West Philadelphia into the business world, where he eventually became Michael Jordan's right-hand man at Nike. Hired by Phil Knight to architect the global expansion of the Jordan Brand, Miller helped turn it into a defining pop culture phenomenon. He went on to become President of the Portland Trail Blazers before returning to Nike, where he currently serves as Chairman of the Jordan Brand Advisory Board. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article1-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid","mid-articleX","mid-article","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[2,2],[300,250],[620,350],[300,251],[501,282],[3,3],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories News How Film Producer Scott Budnick & Celebrity Barber VicBlends Teamed For A New Training Program In California Prisons Documentary Cinetic To Handle Worldwide Sales Of 'Freefall,' Upcoming Documentary On Extraordinary Aerial Daredevils Vince Reffet and Fred Fugen

Integral to the memoir is the secret Miller spent decades hiding behind his success in the boardroom: as a teenage gang member, he was convicted of murder. Jump follows his personal rehabilitation journey after prison while walking a spiritual path. Today, Larry is dedicated to inspiring young people, helping to expand access to education, employment and economic mobility, and proving that incarceration doesn&#x2019;t have to define their future. Watch on Deadline if ( !window.pmc.harmony?.isEventAdScheduledTime() ) { pmcCnx.cmd.push(function() { pmcCnx({ settings: { plugins: { pmcAtlasMG: { iabPlcmt: 2, } } }, playerId: '32fe25c4-79aa-406a-af44-69b41e969e71', playlistId: '0199e506-e642-7728-8264-463efe71337b', }).render("connatix_contextual_player_div"); }); } else { // This should only be get called when page cache is not cleared and it's event time. window.pmc.harmony?.switchToHarmonyPlayer(); }

Budnick and Ameet Shukla will produce for 1Community, the company behind films such as Respect and Just Mercy , with the project overseen by Director of Development Thomas Adam. Miller and Lacy will executive produce.

Budnick told us, &#x201C;Larry&#x2019;s story is one of transformation, accountability and all that is possible when someone is given the opportunity to build a different future. We&#x2019;re incredibly excited to work with Kasi to bring his journey to the screen with the depth and humanity it deserves. At its heart, this is a story about honesty and complexity, all things that fuel all that we do, and we&#x2019;re excited to help tell this story.&#x201D;

Lemmons is the award-winning writer-director behind works including Eve&#x2019;s Bayou , Black Nativity and the Harriet Tubman biopic Harriet for Focus Features, among others. She said, &#x201C;I&#x2019;m thrilled to be a part of this project with Larry, Laila and 1Community. Larry Miller&#x2019;s story is jaw-dropping and inspirational. JUMP dynamically explores the human capacity for transformation and the power of 2nd chances.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dl-mid-article-inject2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article2","mid-articleX","mid-article","mid","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[300,250],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

Miller added, &#x201C;Kasi Lemmons is legendary, and we're honored to see this story from her perspective. 1Community's reputation for thoughtful and powerful storytelling is a perfect fit for JUMP .&#x201D;

The deal was negotiated by Shukla and Karyn Edwards from BALA for 1Community. Lemmons is repped by CAA and Jeanne Bixler Way at Del Shaw Moonves. Miller and Lacy with CAA.

India's official selection for the 2027 Academy Awards is "Gondhal," the debut feature film from director Santosh Davakhar. Following a screening of the film, Davakhar sat down with Variety 's Jazz Tangcay to discuss creating his debut, the Oscar movies that inspired him and the Indian heritage he wants to share through the film.

The film is set in 1960, a post-colonial era where illiteracy was prevalent and women were not afforded agency, Davakhar said. He purposefully chose to that setting and designed the Suman character based on how her situation would have been. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories 'Chasing Summer' Director Josephine Decker Says That ‘Filmmaking Is Lonelier Than Ever,’ So It’s Time to Build a Community

&#x201C;You will feel that she is clever, she is manipulative, she's selfish, but she's just a 17-year-old girl," Davakhar said. "She's very young girl and she's not allowed to break the barriers imposed by society. So she's not openly challenging to the patriarchy, but she's slowly making her choices.&#x201D;

The title of the film is &#x201C;Gondhal,&#x201D; named for the traditional night-long devotional ritual performed for a newly married couple, and the film&#x2019;s plot unfolds during the ritual. The main instrument used during the ritual is on the brink of disappearing because electrical ones are taking its place.

&#x201C;We recorded it live as they performed because if we record this music at studio and then we ask them to perform, the energy will be different,&#x201D; Davakhar said. &#x201C;I want that real energy. I want that real devotion. That was a choice to document these instruments and so that the next generation can see, they can feel it and they can keep it alive.&#x201D;

Much of the film takes place at night, which created unique challenges. Davakhar said they had over one kilometer of lighting. It took seven days to complete the opening shot, which has two or three stitches, and 22 days for the entire project. The music for the film was composed by Ilaiyaraaja. Davakhar said the 83-year-old Indian composer agreed to work on the film on the condition that he visited the remote village the film shot at to watch the ritual. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

&#x201C;He traveled over there 1,700 kilometers,&#x201D; Davakhar said. &#x201C;He watched this ritual which lasted until the morning. And then he went back to the studio and then he composed the music for this film. He's a really great thing. And that's why we Indians call him a god of music.&#x201D;

The film opens with a 25-minute oner, and Davakhar said he was inspired by watching the 2001 Oscar-nominated, Hindi-language film &#x201C;Lagaan." It lost the Best Foreign Language Film award to &#x201C;No Man&#x2019;s Land,&#x201D; and Davakhar wanted to understand why.

&#x201C;When I watched it, I got to know that the powerful cinema is not only about the great actor or a great production budget or a great production value,&#x201D; he said of watching &#x201C;No Man&#x2019;s Land.&#x201D; &#x201C;It's also important about the powerful story, the powerful screenplay and the powerful craft.&#x201D;

Davakhar was not allowed to watch film in theaters because his family considered that a luxury. He recalled watching 40 films in 15 days when his short &#x201C;Adnyat&#x201D; screened at Cannes. After that, he closely watched Oscar-winning films and noted &#x201C;Birdman,&#x201D; &#x201C;1917&#x201D; and &#x201C;Roma&#x201D; as movies that particularly fascinated him.

&#x201C;That's how I understood that the one take is important as storytelling because it allows you to flow with the story," he said. "It doesn't have any visual disruption. That's why I wrote a film which could be in one take.&#x201D;

From his experience at Cannes, Davakhar learned that the global perception of Indian cinema was limited. He wanted to change the perception that Indian cinema is around poverty or classism, so he focused on portraying Indian heritage proudly.

&#x201C;That heritage will be the backdrop of the story, but the human emotion, human conflict, that will be the story,&#x201D; he said.

EXCLUSIVE: Leanne Perice's indie creator management biz, Made By All , has a new senior exec in the ranks.

Former Rolling Stone and Spotter Media exec Christina Tom has been appointed Executive Vice President and Head of Growth. She's got more than two decades of experience building revenues and developing partnerships in the media, entertainment and creator economy spaces.

Her newly created role will see Tom will develop a company-wide growth strategy, help expand the talent roster and management organization, and deepen relationships with brands and agencies. She'll focus on commercial opportunities for Made By All and its clients across digital, social, entertainment and brand partnerships. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article1-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid","mid-articleX","mid-article","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[2,2],[300,250],[620,350],[300,251],[501,282],[3,3],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; }); Related Stories News Endemol Shine Brasil & Grupo Podpah Set Digital Partnership Led By 'Temptation Island' Casting Moby, Hannah Stocking & Adam Rose Set For Microdrama Slate From TikTok & Made By Us Studios

